WEBVTT

00:00:04.209 --> 00:00:10.859
<v Grace Liu>Morning, everyone. Thursday the seventeenth. Can you all hear me? Teams is doing that thing with the microphone again.</v>

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:19.219
<v David Whitfield>Yep. You're clearer than the heating in the portakabin, anyway. That thing's either tropical or completely off.</v>

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.929
<v Jamie Brennan>That's the executive climate-control package, that is.</v>

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:30.600
<v Sarah Okafor>Try the broken coffee machine in the canteen. Cold room, no coffee. Living the dream.</v>

00:00:31.699 --> 00:00:33.100
<v Grace Liu>Right, excellent morale already.</v>

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:40.810
<v Hannah Price>Still better than the football last night. I sat through all of it, more fool me.</v>

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:46.649
