00:03:10.789 --> 00:03:15.340
<v Jamie Brennan>Yeah, the timing makes sense now. Your audio clipped a bit on 'tomorrow'.</v>

00:03:15.719 --> 00:03:17.469
<v Grace Liu>Lovely. Right, the seals next.</v>

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:23.039
<v Sarah Okafor>I'll replace the seals on the Water Booster Pump Monday. Normal priority.</v>

00:03:23.479 --> 00:03:27.680
<v Fiona Doyle>Sarah on the Water Booster Pump seals, Monday, normal priority. Got it.</v>

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:30.810
<v Sarah Okafor>Yep, that's mine.</v>

