00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:50.310
<v Grace Liu>Yeah, with the contractor, by 11am. It matters but it's not urgent.</v>

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:56.660
<v Marcus Hale>Right, agreed. I'll do the site visit at Harbour Road with the contractor by 11am.</v>

00:04:57.259 --> 00:05:01.810
<v Fiona Doyle>Harbour Road, Marc, by 11am. I've got that as important but not urgent.</v>

00:05:02.209 --> 00:05:03.410
<v Marcus Hale>Yep, spot on.</v>

