<v Grace Liu>Hannah, can you organise the toolbox talk for the team this afternoon? Fairly important, that one.</v>

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:16.620
<v Hannah Price>Yeah, I'll organise the toolbox talk for the team this afternoon. Understood, fairly important.</v>

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:20.029
